# Tool policy (optional GXP artifact)

Operator-owned tool and write-scope policy for a run or host. Place a filled
copy in the repo (e.g. `.ai/tool-policy.md`) or under `~/.gxp/` when you want
Phase 0 to read it with PROGRAM / rules / failures. Not auto-evolved.

```markdown
# Tool policy

- A coding agent pointed at a live product tree (Kickoff, WorkshopOS, lumen,
  fab-shop, or any unnamed “find issues” brief) is **read-only** unless the
  brief names writes.
- No exploit-chain retry. Vuln-shaped findings escalate to a human.
- _(Operator-owned; not auto-evolved.)_
```
